        <p>
          At <strong>Flixes</strong> (accessible at <a href="https://flixes.indevs.in/">https://flixes.indevs.in/</a> and <a href="https://ff-carding-portal.vercel.app/">https://ff-carding-portal.vercel.app/</a>), we respect your personal privacy and are committed to protecting the information you share with us. We do <strong>NOT</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal information or Google user data to advertisers or third parties. Our use of Google account data is strictly limited to authenticating your identity and providing you secure access to the Flixes portal.
